WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.958
Get started with EverywherePoster.
Choose a video from your Media Library.

2
00:00:04.958 --> 00:00:09.196
Select your source video,
then choose Add selected media.

3
00:00:09.196 --> 00:00:14.977
Your source stays attached.
Customize the post while keeping control.

4
00:00:14.977 --> 00:00:21.452
Open Caption options. Adapt your own
caption for each platform.

5
00:00:21.452 --> 00:00:28.961
Choose the connected accounts
you want to include.

6
00:00:28.961 --> 00:00:35.658
Review your caption and source preview
before publishing.

7
00:00:35.658 --> 00:00:37.658
Check the other platform’s version, too.

8
00:00:37.658 --> 00:00:40.758
Your next step: open Upload
and add your own source content.
